// original: Image-traced topology review: p05_fig7_miller_opamp.png
// original: Review: batch1_review_all50_20261002; original image and netlist hashes in scope.json.
// original: MOS terminal order: D G S [B]. Explicit body pins follow the image.
// original: Manually repaired topology only; not a native Cadence export or simulation-qualified deck.
// original: Device sizes, model cards, source/passive values and performance are not validated here.
// original: User: the dotted line joins both Rlarge resistors to VBN; Mtail is NMOS.
simulator lang=spectre
global 0
